          "message": {
            "text": "MAX_CACHED_STATES is enforced while loading persisted rows, but queueIngredients unconditionally cache.puts every new BlockKey and has no runtime size check or eviction. A normal player reaches tryAddIngredient from the RIGHT_CLICK_BLOCK handler and can use distinct supported cauldrons and ingredients; integrity cleanup only examines a bounded snapshot per sweep, so stale entries are not an admission control. Each pending state is also persisted, allowing sustained distinct activity to consume heap, database rows, and bounded asynchronous work."
          },
