          "message": {
            "text": "The workflow downloads the fixed-version Maven ZIP with Invoke-WebRequest, extracts it, and only checks that mvn.cmd exists before adding its bin directory to GITHUB_PATH. It then invokes mvn dependency:go-offline and uses Maven during first-party plugin compilation. No SHA256, signature, or independently trusted digest is checked, so compromise of the download origin or artifact can execute code in the GitHub runner and influence build outputs."
          },
