          "message": {
            "text": "confirm_player_recovery_code_sync selects a matching code with status='PENDING', then updates that row to USED without a row lock or a status='PENDING' predicate. Two concurrent confirmations can both observe the same pending code, both change the account password and whitelist link, and both return successfully; the endpoint then issues an authentication pair for each request."
          },
